abstract: >-
  CHEESE is a Streamlit-based engineering dashboard for translating
  laboratory CO₂ electrolysis performance into product-rate, feed,
  utilization, area, stack, carbon-balance, energy, durability, and
  screening-level materials-cost requirements.
